[
    {
        "content": "<p>The code below compiled with <code>leanprover/lean4:4.30.0</code><br>\nbut does not compie any more with <code>leanprover/lean4:4.31.0</code>.</p>\n<p>I cannot find out how to write this <code>instance FromActionOfCoPreSheaf</code><br>\nso that it compiles with <code>leanprover/lean4:4.31.0</code>.</p>\n<p>All help is welcome.</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>Code listing</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Issue</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Functor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">From_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">To_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">morphismMap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">From_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">To_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">export</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Functor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">morphismMap</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FunctionValuedFunctor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Functor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CoPreSheaf</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">FunctionValuedFunctor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FromAction</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Actor_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Upon_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">fromEffectOf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Via_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">Actor_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Via_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Upon_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Via_T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Upon_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">export</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FromAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fromEffectOf</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FromActionOfCoPreSheaf</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Actor_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Upon_BTC</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">coPreSheaf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">CoPreSheaf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Actor_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Upon_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">FromAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Actor_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Upon_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">fromEffectOf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Via_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">morphismMap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">coPreSheaf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Issue</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>",
