    {
        "content": "<p>You should make <code>coPreSheaf</code> instance implicit (i.e. use <code>[coPreSheaf : ...]</code>)</p>",
        "id": 603547375,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1781569982
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>That way, instance synthesis will search for the <code>CoPreSheaf</code> instead of having it be uninferrable</p>",
        "id": 603547551,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1781570033
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>(if that is what you want)</p>",
        "id": 603547620,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1781570062
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks so much Robin! How simple was that ... .!<br>\nMoreover the <code>(self := coPreSheaf From_T)</code> can be left away.</p>\n<p>FYI,  for a similar instance dealing with <code>PreSheaf</code> the <code>(self := PreSheaf To_T)</code> cannot be left away.</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>Code listing</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NoMoreAnIssue</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">linter</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unusedVariables</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Functor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">From_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">To_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">morphismMap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">From_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">To_BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">From_T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">To_T</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">export</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Functor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">morphismMap</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FunctionValuedFunctor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Functor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CoPreSheaf</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">BTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UTC</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span